<title>FINLAND: FINNISH MAY NEW PRIVATE CAR SALES FALL 1.1 PCT Y/Y.</title>
<headline>FINNISH MAY NEW PRIVATE CAR SALES FALL 1.1 PCT Y/Y.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registrations in Finland of new</p>
<p>private cars fell 1.1 percent year-on-year in May to 9,299</p>
<p>units, the Information Centre of the Automobile Branch said in</p>
<p>its monthly review on Friday.</p>
<p>It gave the following figures:</p>
<p>				     change			  change</p>
<p>		    May '97     yr/yr pct    Jan-May '97  yr/yr pct</p>
<p> Private cars    9,299	  -1.1	   50,289	 +4.5</p>
<p> Vans		  884	  +9.4	    4,898	+26.9</p>
<p> Lorries	     343	  -0.9	    1,721	+17.4</p>
<p> Buses		  36	 -18.2		226	 +2.7</p>
<p> Total	    10,562	  -0.4	   57,134	 +6.5</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
